This product includes an independent implementation of the DEBRA-Dust
algorithm described in:

  Miller, S. D., Bankert, R. L., Grasso, L. D., Lindsey, D. T., Kuciauskas,
  A. P., & Combs, C. L. (2017). A dynamic enhancement with background
  reduction algorithm: Overview and application to satellite-based dust storm
  detection. Journal of Geophysical Research: Atmospheres, 122, 12,938-12,959.
  https://doi.org/10.1002/2017JD027365

  Equations follow the erratum published 26 February 2020.

This product also includes an implementation of the classic Dust RGB composite,
a published recipe formalized by EUMETSAT/EUMeTrain and adapted for GOES-R ABI
by the NOAA/NASA GOES-R program (CIRA/RAMMB, NASA SPoRT). Its source
publications are listed in CITATION.cff.

No source publication is distributed with this software. This implementation is
not produced, endorsed, or verified by any author or organization named above.

